Just clarifying that since the beta started we have shipped multiple features publicly. Our Connect Embedded product is live now and documented [here](https://stripe.com/docs/connect/get-started-connect-embedded-components) with multiple embeddable UI components such as showing Payouts or Payments breakdown. You don't need that "Unified Accounts" beta to use it at the very least. But if you do need that beta then you have to work with our support team to give you access first. And we don't give access to most people yet, there's a wait list.

Sorry I can't help more, please reach out to our support team again at https://support.stripe.com/contact and feel free to mention this Github issue an that you spoke to me.

