@remi-stripe @paulasjes-stripe IMHO You should at least provide an option `retryOnRateLimit` because you have small clients, but you have big clients too : @ work we can trigger 1000+ payment in a few seconds because we are doing time-limited auctions and our clients often program all their items to end at a specific time (often Sunday evening)
